@description Perken Console1: plugin maps and language packs
@author Perken
@version 0.1.0
@provides
  Perken/Console1/maps/**/*.ini
  src/resources/langPacks/en.ini > Perken/Console1/langPacks/en.ini
  src/resources/langPacks/fr.ini > Perken/Console1/langPacks/fr.ini
@changelog
  First release as a ReaPack package.
@link
  Source repository https://github.com/AntoineBalaine/perken-reaper-scripts
@about
  # Perken Console1: maps and language packs

  The data files that the Console1 extension reads from Data/Perken/Console1: the maps that connect the knobs of the console to the parameters of the plugins (factory, chmaha and tukan), and the language packs.

  Install it with the Perken Console1 extension. The extension writes a few default maps by itself, but it does not have the other maps or the language packs.
